      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Now, about that griffin matter...",
        "Jp" : "では、件のグリフィンの件なんですが――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286201,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "To make matters worse, it loves man-made objects,\r\ncattle, and shiny things... Everyone in Kinoza\r\nis terrified that their property, carts, or livestock\r\nwill be stolen away in an instant.",
        "Jp" : "面倒なことに、そいつは人工物と牛、\r\nそれに光りモノが大好きで――\r\n家財や荷台、それに家畜がさらわれやしないかと\r\nキノザの皆は戦々恐々"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286202,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Perhaps that oversized eagle is the reason\r\nthe ogres and golems have relocated downhill\r\nto avoid its harassment as well?",
        "Jp" : "もしかしたら、オーガだのなんだのが\r\nふもとへ下りてくるようになったのも、\r\nあの大ワシを避けてのことかもしれませんな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286203,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Kinoza hasn't been attacked by golems and ogres,\r\nbut the Summit Chapel stands visible from here,\r\na small distance to travel by Griffin's wing.",
        "Jp" : "ゴーレムやオーガは、まだ直接キノザを\r\n襲うってほどじゃありませんが、\r\n《山頂の小堂》はここから目で見える距離です\r\nグリフィンの羽根ならひとっ飛びでしょう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 359630,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Please, do something about that Griffin, Arisen!",
        "Jp" : "どうかあの大ワシを\r\nなんとかして下さいよ、われらが覚者さん！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286205,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
