      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "As expected, Ser Arisen!\r\nA splendid defeat of the Griffin.\r\nIt was certainly no match for you.",
        "Jp" : "おお、さすがは覚者さん！\r\n大ワシ討伐、お見事です\r\nさすがのグリフィンも成敗されたようですな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286208,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "However, we found further activity at the nest site,\r\nso there seems to be more than one griffin using it.",
        "Jp" : "しかし、あの巣についてこっちでも状況を\r\n調べていたんですが\r\nどうもあそこを巣にしてるグリフィンは\r\n１頭ではないようでして"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286209,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Though you've graciously slain one, Arisen,\r\nanother griffin may later decide to fly in.\r\nShould that come to pass, we trust you\r\nto handle the matter favorably.",
        "Jp" : "覚者さんが退治されたのと別のグリフィンが\r\nまた飛来するかもしれません\r\nその時はまた、よしなに――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286212,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Although with that said, a Griffin's penchant\r\nfor collecting shiny things could turn into\r\na profitable business, if done right.",
        "Jp" : "しかしあれですなぁ\r\nグリフィンの光りモノ収集癖、\r\nうまくやれば良い商売になりそうですな"
